      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDSTAR GRACE (3) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh at Q Straight, but was among the placings at Q Straight three back. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. GO GO CAMBLA (7) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 20.02 beating TUTA QUEEN. Can make it two on the bounce. KING ROGER (1) missed the frame last time when fifth (17.18) at Casino in a Grade 4/5 but not beaten far the start prior. Rates a winning chance on best. TUTA QUEEN (2) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
